    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="Annotation_Preprocessing">
      <bpmn:text>Preprocessing:
- Near-zero variance
- Load 5 imputed datasets
- Drop constants/leakage
- Ordinal + one-hot encoding
- Competing-risk correction
- 80/20 split (seed=2125), (plan type + completion + event, fallback: plan type + event)</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="Annotation_Discovery">
      <bpmn:text>Discovery Phase (ML selection):

- HP tuning: Optuna 2-phase
- NSGA-II multi-objective
• Death: 100 trials, Readm: 100
• Stochastic MI (1 imp/trial)
• Pareto: C-index vs IBS
- SHAP: global importance + bootstrap CI
- Interactions: FDR + SMD enrichment
- Functional forms: polynomial + F-test

Cross-Validation:
- 5-fold stratified CV
- Dual stratification (plan+event)
- Across 5 imputations
- Early stopping (100 rounds)</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="Annotation_Prediction">
      <bpmn:text>Prediction Phase (Cox models):

- Iterative refinement (Uno C + IBS)
- Integrate Phase-1 insights
- Select final model</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="Annotation_Validation">
      <bpmn:text>Validation Phase:
- Test set predictions (20%)
- Uno's C-index (IPCW, multi-horizon)
- Recalibration: KM + Aalen-Johansen
- Decision Curve Analysis
- Clinical utility assessment</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Assoc_Pre" sourceRef="SubProcess_Preprocessing" targetRef="Annotation_Preprocessing" />
    <bpmn:association id="Assoc_Pred" sourceRef="SubProcess_Death_Prediction" targetRef="Annotation_Prediction" />
    <bpmn:association id="Assoc_Val" sourceRef="SubProcess_Death_Validation" targetRef="Annotation_Validation" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_00dlt6b">
      <bpmn:text>Prediction Phase (Cox models):

- Filter: corr&gt;0.90, VIF&gt;5
- Time-dependency: Schoenfeld plots</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_0kc70ju" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="Activity_0c096mg" targetRef="TextAnnotation_00dlt6b" />
